---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_OWNER } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description={`Privacy policy for ${SITE_OWNER}.`}
	pubDate={new Date('2026-10-03')}
	affiliate={false}
>
	<p>This page explains what information {SITE_OWNER} collects and how it is used.</p>

	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<p>
		We do not ask you to create an account or submit personal information. We use Cloudflare Web
		Analytics, which collects anonymous, aggregated visit data (such as pages viewed and country)
		without cookies and without identifying you.
	</p>

	<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
	<p>
		Some links on this site are affiliate links, including links to products sold through ClickBank.
		When you click one, you leave this site and the merchant or affiliate network may use cookies to
		record that the sale came from us. Their use of your data is covered by their own privacy
		policies.
	</p>

	<h2>Third-party sites</h2>
	<p>
		We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of other websites we link to. Please
		review their privacy policies before providing any information.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>Questions? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Layout>
